WEBVTT

NOTE Call with Theo Marsh, Birch & Co. Monday 28 September 2026, 17:40. Speakers: Theo Marsh, Sam Rivera.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Theo Marsh>Sam. Quick one, I'm walking out of the board.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Sam Rivera>Go on.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
<v Theo Marsh>They said yes. Nordic entry, through one distributor, the way the memo put it. Launch in March.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Sam Rivera>March. That lines up with what the carriers can do.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:32.000
<v Theo Marsh>Good. I want the launch plan in draft by Friday the ninth. Something I can put in front of the board again in October.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.000
<v Sam Rivera>The ninth is fine. I'll need the budget envelope to fill it in.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Theo Marsh>You'll have it by Wednesday. And on carriers: go with whoever you think is right, but I want two quotes on paper before we sign.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.000
<v Sam Rivera>Understood. One is in. I am chasing the other.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Theo Marsh>Good work on the sizing. Talk Friday week.
